# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PROJECT RULES — ENTERPRISE NEXT.JS APP ROUTER STACK
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This file is the persistent AI skill for this workspace.
# Every AI assistant (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) must treat
# these rules as strict constraints, not suggestions.

## Tech Stack

### Base & Runtime
- Next.js 15+ (App Router) + TypeScript — src/ directory layout
- Node.js for server routes; Edge runtime for lightweight API handlers

### Database & Storage
- Supabase (managed PostgreSQL)
- Drizzle ORM — schema in src/lib/db/schema.ts, migrations in src/lib/db/migrations/
- pgvector extension — 768-dim embeddings, HNSW index (vector_cosine_ops)
- Dexie.js (IndexedDB) — local-first offline data via src/lib/db/dexie.ts

### AI
- @ai-sdk/google — Gemini 2.5 Flash-Lite (simple/default), 3.1 Flash-Lite (super-complex only), text-embedding-004
- Vercel AI SDK — streamObject() for streaming, generateObject() for one-shot
- Zod — all AI output schemas defined with z.object()
- src/lib/ai/instructor.ts — retry wrapper around generateObject()

### Auth
- better-auth with Drizzle adapter, email+password + Google OAuth
- Auth route at /api/auth/[...all] — Node.js runtime only

### State Management
- Zustand + persist middleware → client UI state (src/store/app.store.ts)
- TanStack Query → server/async data state
- Dexie.js → offline/local-first data

### Job Queues
- Upstash QStash — publishJob() in src/server/queues/qstash.ts
- Webhook handler at /api/queue/webhook — edge runtime, Zod-validated

### Scraping
- Playwright + custom stealth init script — src/lib/scraping/stealth.ts
- SERVER ONLY — never import scraping code in client components or edge routes

### Client OS / Sandboxes
- @webcontainer/api — singleton boot, src/lib/sandboxes/webcontainer.ts
- Pyodide — singleton loadPyodide(), src/lib/sandboxes/pyodide.ts
  ⚠ COOP/COEP headers required (set in next.config.js)
  ⚠ Use redirect OAuth — popups break under these headers

### Document Parsing
- pdfjs-dist + mammoth — run INSIDE parser.worker.ts via Comlink
- NEVER import pdfjs-dist or mammoth directly in React components

### In-Browser ML
- @xenova/transformers — keep in a dedicated ML worker (not parser worker)
- NEVER bundle model weights — always stream from HuggingFace CDN

### UI
- Tailwind CSS (utility-first)
- shadcn/ui components in src/components/ui/ (built on Radix UI)
- cn() from src/lib/utils/cn.ts for className merging
- Sonner (toasts), cmdk (command palette), Tiptap (rich text), dnd-kit
- react-markdown for rendering AI-generated Markdown

## Directory Rules

| Path | Contents |
|---|---|
| src/app/ | App Router pages and layouts |
| src/app/api/ | Route handlers — edge runtime unless using Node.js APIs |
| src/components/ui/ | shadcn/ui components only — do not add custom logic |
| src/components/editor/ | Tiptap editor components |
| src/components/layout/ | Layout primitives (sidebar, topbar, shell) |
| src/components/shared/ | Reusable domain components |
| src/lib/ai/ | Gemini wrappers, Zod schemas, structured extraction |
| src/lib/db/ | Drizzle schema, postgres client, Dexie client |
| src/lib/db/schema.ts | SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for all table definitions |
| src/lib/scraping/ | SERVER ONLY: Playwright stealth config |
| src/lib/workers/ | *.worker.ts files + Comlink hooks |
| src/lib/sandboxes/ | WebContainers + Pyodide singleton wrappers |
| src/lib/auth/ | better-auth config |
| src/lib/utils/ | Pure utility functions (cn, formatters, etc.) |
| src/server/queues/ | QStash publish/consume logic |
| src/store/ | Zustand stores |
| src/hooks/ | Custom React hooks |
| src/types/ | Global TypeScript declarations |

## Coding Rules

1. **All files**: TypeScript (.ts / .tsx) — no .js in src/
2. **Exports**: Named exports everywhere except Next.js page/layout/route files
3. **Imports**: Always use @/ absolute imports, never relative ../..
4. **ClassNames**: Always use cn() from @/lib/utils/cn
5. **Edge runtime**: Add `export const runtime = "edge"` to all API routes UNLESS
   the route imports: better-auth, node-postgres/drizzle, playwright, or Node.js crypto
6. **Request validation**: Validate ALL request bodies with Zod before processing
7. **Schema changes**: Edit src/lib/db/schema.ts only, then run `npm run db:generate`
8. **AI streaming**: streamObject() for SSE responses, generateObject() for one-shot
9. **State routing**:
   - Client UI state → Zustand store
   - Server/async data → TanStack Query
   - Offline/local data → Dexie
10. **Heavy parsing**: PDF/DOCX MUST run in parser.worker.ts via useParserWorker hook
11. **Scraping**: Import stealth.ts only in server-side route handlers, never in components

## Database — pgvector Bootstrap Checklist
After first `npm run db:migrate`, run these in Supabase SQL editor:
```sql
CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;
CREATE INDEX ON embeddings USING hnsw (embedding vector_cosine_ops)
  WITH (m = 16, ef_construction = 64);
```

