## ⛔  NO SPYWARE POLICY — STRICTLY ENFORCED — ZERO EXCEPTIONS
## ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
NEVER install, import, or suggest the following:
- PostHog
- Google Analytics / gtag / GA4
- Mixpanel
- Segment
- Amplitude
- Hotjar
- FullStory / LogRocket
- Heap
- Sentry (performance tracing — error-only self-hosted is OK)
- Clarity (Microsoft)
- Any third-party analytics beacon, pixel, or fingerprinting script
- Any session recording tool

Server-side application logging for debugging purposes is permitted.
No user data must be sent to third-party analytics services.
